Package: rust187
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Rust 1.87 compiler and cargo (official binaries)
 Official Rust 1.87.0 toolchain repackaged for DankLinux OBS builds.
 Debian 13 ships rustc 1.85, which is older than the niri 26.4 MSRV
 (rustc 1.87). This package installs rustc and cargo under
 /usr/lib/rust-1.87.0/ so packages can use them without replacing the
 distro toolchain.
 .
 Binaries: /usr/lib/rust-1.87.0/bin/rustc and cargo.
